  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T07:10:14.091128Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T07:46:24.175852Z",
  "totalBlocks": 120,
  "translatedBlocks": 120,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "225300b58cebe242",
      "translationZh": "工业安全 AI 是指利用计算机视觉和预测分析等技术来发现并防止工作场所中的危险。合成数据增强正成为解决工业安全 AI 中最棘手问题之一的实用方案：描绘人员与重型机械距离过近、处于危险状态的训练图像十分稀缺。部署自主设备的行业（例如农业、建筑业、采矿业和制造业）需要可靠的人员检测模型。然而，风险最高的场景（例如工人站在视野盲区、儿童靠近正在移动的作业机具）恰恰是现实世界数据集中最罕见的场景。为了采集数据而人为布置这些场景，也最为危险。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "508359084eb14a22",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将展示如何使用基于 Amazon SageMaker AI 和 Amazon Rekognition 构建的合成数据增强流水线，生成带有自动标签的照片级逼真训练图像。我们的实验表明，无需人工标注或危险的拍摄活动，人员检测的 mAP50（交并比阈值为 0.5 时的平均精度均值）即可提升高达 160%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36d5217adeeb8e7c",
      "translationZh": "挑战：安全关键型边缘场景的训练数据稀缺",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fe4a0f11c83fc19",
      "translationZh": "为重型机械开发 AI 驱动安全系统的工业企业面临一个关键瓶颈。它们需要数千至数百万张展示人员在设备附近处于危险位置的训练图像，以训练能够帮助预防事故的目标检测模型。然而，这类数据极难获取：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "152c6eab25f20388",
      "translationZh": "安全与伦理：为了拍照而故意将人员（包括儿童等弱势群体）置于正在运转的机械附近，既不安全，也不符合伦理，而且往往不切实际。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "521d943fca985e19",
      "translationZh": "真实事件的罕见性：最值得关注的危险场景（人员站在轨道上、攀爬设备或处于车辆行驶路径上）在自然采集的数据集中最为罕见。这会造成严重的类别不平衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f16ea17f9b5ec7a",
      "translationZh": "成本与规模：人工数据采集和标注的估计成本为每张图像 3–5，且难以扩展规模，标注团队通常每天只能处理约 2,000 张图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fcad5c79f89d742e",
      "translationZh": "边缘部署约束：检测模型必须在与设备位于同一现场的边缘设备上运行（例如安装在拖拉机、叉车或铁路车辆上的摄像头），这使模型规模受限，只能采用轻量级架构，因此每一个训练样本都格外重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bad323db710eeda4",
      "translationZh": "这些挑战使得部署在边缘端的模型，在检测失败后果最为严重的场景中，恰恰缺乏足够的人员检测训练信号。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9501e119972b5971",
      "translationZh": "解决方案架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f471c6209f3ef77",
      "translationZh": "本节介绍我们的端到端合成数据增强流水线，该流水线分两个阶段运行：照片级逼真图像生成和自动标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf0a4cf3cbe60aa8",
      "translationZh": "两阶段合成数据生成框架概述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "016bddacb3df5a9f",
      "translationZh": "我们的解决方案是一条端到端合成数据增强流水线，无需人工标注即可生成带标签的训练图像。该流水线分两个阶段运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "191b05771f1537e0",
      "translationZh": "照片级逼真合成图像生成——托管在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上的基于扩散的模型（Qwen-Image-Edit-2509）将合成人物插入真实场景图像，同时保持背景、光照和尺度不变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c530aa7f3600b75",
      "translationZh": "自动标注——Amazon Rekognition DetectLabels API 自动为插入的人物生成边界框标注，从而减轻人工标注工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8028ab504d88059b",
      "translationZh": "在我们的方法中，我们编辑真实图像，而不是从零开始生成完全合成的场景。这保留了背景的保真度，避免了域差距，并使现有的设备标注保持有效。域差距是指在一种数据分布（例如完全合成的场景）上训练的模型应用于真实世界图像时出现的性能下降。扩散模型对场景的理解能够生成符合上下文的插入内容，并呈现逼真的光照和比例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ed9c74b95cfe27c",
      "translationZh": "阶段 1：照片级逼真的合成图像生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43e4a724181d8550",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 ml.g5.12xlarge 实例（4× NVIDIA A10G GPU，总显存为 96 GB），在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上部署 Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 扩散模型。该模型接收一个结构化提示词，其中指定：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba65918e18727128",
      "translationZh": "待插入对象：一名性别随机的人，以实现人口统计特征的多样性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3409f7bb7eeee94",
      "translationZh": "放置策略：将人物放在相对于设备而言危险的位置（例如轨道上、设备顶部、悬挂在边缘，或站在车辆行驶路径上）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b230fd7cb36a8e8d",
      "translationZh": "约束条件：不使现有元素发生畸变、对焦清晰，并与场景真实融合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07a23523ea69e2cd",
      "translationZh": "该模型以包含设备但没有人物的真实图像为底图进行编辑，在插入合成人物的同时保留原始场景的背景、光照和比例。这种原位编辑方法避免了困扰全合成场景生成的域差距问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4d23a1629611c356",
      "translationZh": "阶段 2：使用 Amazon Rekognition 进行自动标注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c9111217e37d0d8",
      "translationZh": "每张生成的图像都通过 Amazon Rekognition DetectLabels API 进行处理，最低置信度阈值设为 80%。检测到的边界框使用 IoU 阈值 > 0.5 的非极大值抑制（NMS）进行去重，并转换为 YOLO 格式。这些伪标签（自动生成以替代人工标注的机器生成标注）会与原始图像中已有的设备标注合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b75a80ad0c8a4764",
      "translationZh": "这种自动标注减轻了合成图像的人工标注负担，同时保持了足以用于训练边缘端部署的检测器的标签质量。合成图像及其自动生成的标注与真实训练数据相结合，构成最终训练集。预处理和后处理步骤（图像筛选、图像尺寸调整、提示词组装和标签处理）使该流水线能够以自动化工作流的形式运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "370cf2dc684fe360",
      "translationZh": "实现细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77dd38741fec7c7f",
      "translationZh": "本节介绍模型部署配置、合成图像生成方法以及自动标注流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eda645cccac6b257",
      "translationZh": "技术设置与配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86b71b02b8b61914",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 模型部署在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上，配置如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7e4641f56c6f6ec",
      "translationZh": "实例类型：ml.g5.12xlarge（4× NVIDIA A10G GPU，显存总量为 96 GB）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74fb8809b9559219",
      "translationZh": "模型大小：约 60 GB 的未量化权重，分布在 4 个 GPU 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11f55530bea77e3a",
      "translationZh": "最小图像尺寸：512 px。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d32e8cdbac2ab2c8",
      "translationZh": "生成时间：每张图像约 166 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d79e7507f4470f8a",
      "translationZh": "该模型需要自定义设备映射，将其 60 个 Transformer 层分布到可用的 GPU 上。为了实现高效推理，我们建议避免跨设备通信。可部署在具有足够显存的单个 GPU 上，例如 ml.p5.4xlarge 实例提供的 NVIDIA H100 GPU，或采用权重量化技术。我们预计，使用此类硬件后，每张图像的推理成本将降至原来的约 1/10，但这一测量结果尚未得到验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e8dfb68c7caeb89",
      "translationZh": "合成人物插入方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0819f75e857b2ec9",
      "translationZh": "该流水线选择包含机车但没有人物的真实训练图像作为编辑底图。对于每张图像，扩散模型都会接收一个结构化提示词。以下是一个提示词结构示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0719c78cab05fd3",
      "translationZh": "我们的实验揭示了一项关键发现：由提示词引导的放置位置是影响下游检测性能的最重要因素。指示模型将人物放置在与该领域相关的危险位置，使人物检测的 mAP50 翻了一番，而将人物放置在背景中实际上降低了性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d6f92accd17391d",
      "translationZh": "集成 Amazon Rekognition 以实现自动标注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c3915748162d305",
      "translationZh": "每张生成的图像都通过 Amazon Rekognition DetectLabels API 进行处理。模型使用以下查询词计算人物的边界框：person、human、man、woman、boy、girl、child、adult、people。这实现了大规模标签创建的自动化。我们使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "838c26e97d044bdc",
      "translationZh": "最低置信度阈值：80%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a888860bafdf3b7",
      "translationZh": "后处理：非极大值抑制（NMS），IoU 阈值 > 0.5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e4cd444ebba800b",
      "translationZh": "标签格式：将边界框转换为 YOLO 格式，并与现有的设备标注合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82454621826c8b10",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 OpenImages 的一个子集，作为客户工业设备数据集的可公开分享的替代数据集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b19da06002c5b1c",
      "translationZh": "真实训练图像：来自 OpenImages 的约 3,200 张包含火车的图像（用火车代替重型机械）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16946157603e2698",
      "translationZh": "合成增强：额外增加最多 1,000 张以合成方式插入人物的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "183549cd0972739b",
      "translationZh": "测试集：仅包含真实的 OpenImages 图像（无合成数据），经过筛选，每张图像至少包含一台机车。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c04a6cdc2444fba",
      "translationZh": "任务：存在严重类别不平衡的双类别检测（人和火车）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6f63368f4a7492c6",
      "translationZh": "结果与性能提升",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca7bc7462f67834c",
      "translationZh": "我们从三个维度评估了合成数据增强的影响：提示词中的放置策略、合成数据量和模型容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "652bcad2e4602cd9",
      "translationZh": "评估方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0802a8e820cc7e3b",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 YOLO11 作为具有代表性的可在边缘端部署的检测器系列来评估我们的流水线，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上使用 PyTorch 2.1.0 进行训练。模型训练时，图像尺寸设为 640，采用早停机制（patience 为 50），最多训练 500 个轮次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e114aa232abda56f",
      "translationZh": "关键发现 1：与领域相关的放置方式使检测性能翻倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2242dd753dbaf69f",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 YOLO11-nano 进行提示词消融研究，将四种合成数据条件与仅使用真实数据的基线进行比较。每种场景均使用 1,000 张合成图像。下表展示了各场景的关键性能指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3634ea114d647591",
      "translationZh": "汇总 mAP50（人员和列车）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3159f99ccc7eceda",
      "translationZh": "危险位置 + 场景变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93efeffe2e1f26eb",
      "translationZh": "背景位置 + 场景变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c253911545acdcab",
      "translationZh": "要点：模型生成什么（处于领域相关位置的人），远比围绕其如何改变场景（例如环境条件或一天中的时段）重要。将人放置在危险位置使人员类别的 mAP50 翻了一倍（从 0.051 提升至 0.106），而将人放置在背景中则使其略有下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "394de6bc1d545f97",
      "translationZh": "关键发现 2：最优合成数据量是一个超参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b74a740d82eccbcb",
      "translationZh": "为探究合成数据量对检测性能的影响，我们在保持人员放置条件和模型规模不变（危险位置放置、无场景变化，YOLO11-nano）的情况下，将合成图像数量在 250-1,000 范围内进行扫描测试。下表展示了各个场景的关键性能指标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbb54d426d2d12c0",
      "translationZh": "要点：在我们的实验中，使用 750 张合成图像时性能达到峰值，人员类别的 mAP50 相比基线提高了 160%（从 0.051 提升至 0.134）。超过这一数量后，累积的生成伪影（例如面部失真和过度饱和）引入了噪声，导致定位置信度和检测覆盖率均下降。应将合成数据量视为需要验证的超参数，而不是一味将其最大化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80a373c7e24f15e0",
      "translationZh": "关键发现 3：让模型容量与数据集规模相匹配",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58fa052f828d58ed",
      "translationZh": "为探究模型容量的影响，我们使用 1,000 张合成图像（危险位置放置、无场景变化），对 YOLO11 的五种模型规模进行了扫描测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "631fe17f6a5fa5dd",
      "translationZh": "要点：YOLO11-medium 实现了最佳总体性能（mAP50 为 0.604）和最高的人员召回率（0.340），召回率相比基线翻了一倍。拥有 57M 参数的 XLarge 模型性能回落至 Nano+synth 的结果以下，这表明，在仅有约 4,200 张训练图像的情况下，数据不足以对这种容量的模型进行正则化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "86827574f4f22fc9",
      "translationZh": "对安全关键型应用的意义",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "854dea45ed510199",
      "translationZh": "这些流水线改进相结合，对安全尤为重要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd0ea814f55eef2b",
      "translationZh": "采用中等容量模型后，人员召回率从 17% 翻倍至 34%，这意味着系统检测到的处于危险位置的人员数量增加了一倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b74ca841781a416c",
      "translationZh": "整体检测性能保持稳定：在所有条件下，列车检测的 mAP50 均保持稳定（范围为 0.73–0.79）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9fea6f216f17dc9",
      "translationZh": "可部署于边缘端：所有改进均通过一个参数量为 20M 的模型实现，该模型适合在边缘硬件上进行实时推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2e8c274bf5a1bb54",
      "translationZh": "成本与效率效益",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf535db1b969ef54",
      "translationZh": "与人工数据采集相比，合成数据流水线在成本、安全和速度方面具有显著优势。在以下各节中，我们将比较这两种方法，概述可扩展性方面的优势，并总结从开发到部署所需时间的改善。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69f6570b2a24aa84",
      "translationZh": "合成生成与人工采集及标注的比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91eac48c5d958e7e",
      "translationZh": "除了降低单张图像的成本外，该流水线还提供了结构性优势，而且随着团队扩大训练数据工作的规模，这些优势会不断累积。下表从五个不同维度比较了合成数据增强流水线与人工方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "268388affdc8c622",
      "translationZh": "3–5（采集 + 标注）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "346068695ce9a540",
      "translationZh": "0.33，假设 GPU 推理耗时约 166 秒（ml.g5.12xlarge 实例为 7.09/小时）+ Amazon Rekognition DetectLabels API 调用（0.001/图像）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e369a103ea1ea284",
      "translationZh": "需要人为布置危险场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0112b3d89d03995",
      "translationZh": "降低人身风险",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bbac4541049a2b2",
      "translationZh": "手动绘制边界框",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52323c35bcfca810",
      "translationZh": "通过 Amazon Rekognition 实现全自动化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fd5d612df0b4827",
      "translationZh": "需要多年才能自然发生",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76355abad9d17582",
      "translationZh": "按需无限生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dc1322d25f6054e",
      "translationZh": "团队协作下约 2,000 张图像/天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "888758bf1146aafc",
      "translationZh": "仅受计算预算限制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "12c6a5a5c0bca6fe",
      "translationZh": "可扩展性优势",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed6d1ee259e5bc87",
      "translationZh": "无限场景生成：为各种可通过文本提示描述的危险位置配置生成训练图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "328327946dfb0933",
      "translationZh": "模块化提示结构：你可以替换针对特定领域（建筑、农业、仓储）的放置指令，同时复用生成和伪标签标注基础设施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "555fff45ac4dbf44",
      "translationZh": "云原生架构：完全基于托管 AWS 服务构建，无需自定义基础设施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2b2e647cbaadf0ae",
      "translationZh": "部署所需时间的改善",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b544c4917db830d5",
      "translationZh": "通过减轻人工数据收集和标注的负担，该流水线缩短了从发现训练数据缺口到准备好可用于模型训练的已标注图像之间的过程。这将所需时间从数周或数月缩短至数小时。基础设施可复用：设置完成后，为新场景生成额外训练数据只需新的提示模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bc9832811c2709e",
      "translationZh": "此解决方案的代码可在我们的 GitHub 仓库中获取。要在您自己的环境中部署此解决方案，请按照以下各节中的说明操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f0c4aea964b0bc37",
      "translationZh": "仓库结构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8d2a6281576cc96",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 仓库包含以下目录和文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4fd87bcf0a21586",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，您需要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fd2059165295148",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.11（>=3.11,<3.12）和 uv。我们已使用此 Python 版本进行测试，但其他版本也可能适用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07e36bc936003d25",
      "translationZh": "一个已配置凭证的 AWS 账户（通过 aws configure、环境变量或 AWS Identity and Access Management（IAM）角色配置）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15af938c5008a493",
      "translationZh": "用于图像编辑步骤的、具有 40 GB+ 显存的 GPU（单块 H100/B200），或用于分片路径的多 GPU 实例，例如 ml.g5.12xlarge（4× A10G）。该流水线已配置为在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fc96602ab861481",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker AI GPU 服务配额。新账户的 GPU 训练实例配额为 0（例如 ml.g5.12xlarge）。启动作业之前，请在 AWS Service Quotas 控制台中申请提高配额。否则，作业将失败或一直处于等待状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3fc815e008a3facd",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Rekognition 访问权限（rekognition:DetectLabels）：一项按使用量计费的 AWS 服务，用于为合成人物自动标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc88f04b78fe1ca6",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 访问权限，用于下载 Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 模型权重（首次运行时自动下载）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3b83aab3527b8e7",
      "translationZh": "按照 README.md 中 Usage 部分的说明执行步骤 1–6：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f2c04aa1ac3a37a",
      "translationZh": "摘自 README 的 Usage 部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b8b0694773424e5",
      "translationZh": "下载 OpenImages 数据：创建一个 Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）存储桶，然后运行 data_prep/download_openimages.py，将 Train 类别的图像（训练/验证/测试划分）从公共 OpenImages Amazon S3 镜像复制到你的存储桶中。仅包含图像，暂不包含标签。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05ebb31c35b368fe",
      "translationZh": "暂存标注 CSV 文件：将四个 OpenImages 标注 CSV 文件（由步骤 1 缓存在本地）复制到 s3://<amzn-s3-demo-bucket>/datasets/openimages/annotations/，因为步骤 3 和 4 会从那里读取这些文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75fa462b955c0d2b",
      "translationZh": "创建 YOLO 数据集：运行 data_prep/create_yolo_dataset.py，将下载的图像重新组织为 YOLO 的 images/ 和 labels/ 目录结构，并生成 data.yaml / data-with-synthetic.yaml，使用暂存的 CSV 文件构建标签。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b01733b1fbc1b536",
      "translationZh": "生成合成数据：使用 qwen_image_edit/generate_synthetic.py（通过 generate.ipynb 交互式运行、作为批处理脚本运行，或使用 launch_generation.py 将其作为 Amazon SageMaker AI 作业启动），通过 Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 向训练图像中添加合成人物，并使用 Amazon Rekognition 为其生成伪标签。在 --dataset-prefix 下生成一个完整的增强数据集，并附带其自身的 data.yaml。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd1d533f14f16e09",
      "translationZh": "训练 YOLO 模型：运行 yolo_training/launch_training.py 两次：一次使用步骤 3 的基线前缀（仅含原始图像），另一次使用步骤 4 的输出前缀（原始图像 + 合成图像），以生成一个基线模型和一个经合成数据增强的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ada0d281a151b530",
      "translationZh": "评估：使用 evaluation/ 中的脚本（download_testdata.py、run_eval.py、extract_per_class.py、compare_results.py），在留出的测试集上验证两个训练好的模型，并比较合成数据增强是否改善了检测效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72482924eeb3b3a4",
      "translationZh": "该流水线的设计不依赖于特定领域。无论你的用例涉及建筑工地、农业设备、制造车间还是仓库运营，都可以采用相同的架构，并搭配针对特定领域的提示词模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44999f125b2679e6",
      "translationZh": "完成实验后，请移除以下资源，以避免持续产生费用。Amazon SageMaker AI 训练和处理作业以及 Amazon Rekognition API 调用仅在运行期间计费，并会自动停止产生费用。不过，有些资源会一直保留，直到你将其删除：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b61e72bc7934a29b",
      "translationZh": "停止或删除任何正在运行的 Amazon SageMaker AI 笔记本实例（步骤 4 中交互式 generate.ipynb 路径所使用的实例）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b50bfa04c3ce4c6a",
      "translationZh": "如果不再需要，请删除 Amazon S3 存储桶中的内容（以及存储桶本身）。所有数据集、标注 CSV 文件、合成图像/标签和训练输出都存放在你于步骤 1 中创建的存储桶下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44e84dd03f18c15b",
      "translationZh": "移除 Amazon SageMaker AI 执行角色（可选）。IAM 角色本身不产生费用，因此这一步是为了保持资源整洁和保障安全，而不是为了避免计费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdf4b2617f5af6c5",
      "translationZh": "我们介绍了一条实用的端到端合成数据增强流水线，用于应对工业安全 AI 中训练数据稀缺这一关键挑战。该流水线将 Amazon SageMaker AI 上基于扩散的图像编辑与通过 Amazon Rekognition 进行的自动伪标注相结合，无需人工标注或危险场景布置，即可生成具有照片级真实感且带有标签的训练图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "757ca1b7517ebf48",
      "translationZh": "我们的受控实验得出了三条可操作的指导原则：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c3cad83d441ab03",
      "translationZh": "通过提示词指定符合领域需求的放置位置：合成对象相对于设备的空间位置是提升检测效果的主导因素。视觉多样性（天气、光照）则是次要因素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fad9459954bad4ac",
      "translationZh": "验证合成数据量：合成数据并非越多越好。检测性能会在合成数据量达到最优值时达到峰值。超过这一点后，累积的生成伪影会引入噪声，导致模型性能下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec690b6f9c0dca83",
      "translationZh": "使模型容量与数据预算相匹配：在训练数据总量有限的情况下，中等规模的边缘模型表现优于规模更小或更大的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdd77f6a5ece43d5",
      "translationZh": "结果是：一个可部署在边缘端的模型，其人员检测 mAP50 提升了 160%，召回率翻倍，而且无需人工标注，也无需开展危险的数据采集工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "765aa7def5eced5c",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用此解决方案，请访问我们的 GitHub 仓库。要进一步了解本文使用的服务，请参阅以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
